		{
			dependencies: [
				"695A658C30C5B030"
				"109BD4CCCD1F5D59"
			]
			description: [
				"Sour gas is fuel gas carrying hydrogen sulfide, which poisons and flashes. Clean it, and the sulfur comes out."
				""
				"A vat of red mud with no mixer cleans sour gas piped through it, and the foul red mud, aired in an open basin, goes red again and drops sulfur. Or wash the gas with soda ash solution in a stirred vat, boil the foul soda for hydrogen sulfide, and burn that over alumina in a Steel Furnace into molten sulfur."
				""
				"&7JEI: the Airing tab.&r"
			]
			id: "21D1DCB0DD850FAC"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "Cleaned out of sour gas"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "21A5D0ECAFF9CBD6"
					item: "mcremix:sulfur"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Sulfur"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"21D1DCB0DD850FAC"
				"754D20403EEE0165"
			]
			description: [
				"Sulfur burns away in a Furnace into sulfur dioxide, which platinum gauze in a &6Hot&r Steel Furnace turns to sulfur trioxide. Stirred into water in a vat it becomes sulfuric acid, but half of it fogs off as an acid mist unless there is acid in the vat already."
				""
				"Mixed with nitric acid, it nitrates four times as fast."
			]
			id: "6B61D77A597EB929"
			rewards: [ ]
			subtitle: "Sulfur, burnt twice"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "67A4661495A6D726"
					item: "mcremix:sulfuric_acid_bucket"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "Sulfuric Acid"
			x: 1.75d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"64207D5B90DBDEF5"
				"670869AA09CABEE6"
			]
			description: [
				"Light oil nitrated becomes nitrobenzene, and nitrobenzene with iron and vinegar becomes aniline. These are mixed in basins, and JEI shows each step."
			]
			id: "452A4DAE3CE278D9"
			rewards: [ ]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.5d
			subtitle: "The root of the dyes"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "4AF9FFA7DED2C3FB"
